      "writtenOn": "2022-06-06T21:15:48Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "\u003e \u003e OK. Will the EC send out (VIRTUAL_MUX) host events to the AP when DP alt mode is entered?\n\u003e \n\u003e I thought when we discussed the feature progression diagrams we decided to skip the virtual mux step for external mux boards? \n\nYep, that\u0027s right; the AP alt mode driver will direct the entry, so no events required. At present though, the EC  DP module is governing alt mode entry (IIUC); so in the current state, how does the EC tell the AP that DP alt mode has been entered and we need to update the muxes/retimers (my apologies if I inadvertently conflated VIRTUAL_MUX usage here, but that\u0027s the closest analog I am familiar with)?",
      "parentUuid": "e12e3d01_c78573d7",
      "revId": "48f6e378bec40a4550490367cc6ed9eb1aea9cc5",
      "serverId": "3ce6091f-6c88-37e8-8c75-72f92ae8dfba"
